            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>PersistenceScope</td>
                <td>NxGridPersistenceScope</td>
                <td>All</td>
                <td>Controls which parts of state are saved/restored by StateKey. Combine flags: <code>Widths | Sort | Filters | Frozen | Hidden</code>. Default is All.</td>
                <td><a href="state-persistence">State Persistence</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Virtualize</td>
                <td>bool</td>
                <td>true</td>
